1
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:09,120
Mâine e ziua dumneavoastră.

2
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:11,160
Cred că-i un cadou de la surori.

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,462
Merg să-mi iau camera,

4
00:00:13,462 --> 00:00:15,120
trebuie să imortalizez asta.

5
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,280
La mulți ani, Timi!

6
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,000
Ăsta e cadoul tău.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:26,320
Uau!

8
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,360
Asta e mașina mea preferată!

9
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,760
Am văzut-o doar la TV.

10
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,563
O să-ți iau una reală

11
00:00:31,563 --> 00:00:33,280
când faci 18 ani, promit!

12
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,160
Ești cea mai tare, Giana!

13
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,040
Giana și-a adus aminte.

14
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,120
Hahahaha.

15
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:45,520
Oh.

16
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:46,264
Hey!

17
00:00:46,264 --> 00:00:47,320
Ia-ți mâinile de pe ea!

18
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:48,360
E a mea.

19
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,080
Uite, deja e zgâriată.

20
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:51,160
Derbedeul dracului!

21
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,280
Ce naiba ai cu tine?

22
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,778
Nu ți-am făcut nimic niciodată.

23
00:00:58,778 --> 00:00:59,255
Și?

24
00:00:59,279 --> 00:01:00,735
Doar prezența ta mă enervează.

25
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:02,323
Acum depărtează-te de

26
00:01:02,323 --> 00:01:03,130
mașina mea.

27
00:01:03,154 --> 00:01:03,960
Mașina ta?

28
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,360
Normal că e a mea.

29
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:08,895
Oh, stai.

30
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,080
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

31
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,120
Nu cred.

32
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,720
Credeai că e a ta?

33
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:14,280
Hahaha!

34
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:15,480
Mâine e ziua mea.

35
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,000
Giana mi-a cumpărat-o.

36
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,360
La ce mă așteptam?

37
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:21,360
În fine, bucură-te de cadou.

38
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:22,880
Stai, stai, stai!

39
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,120
Nu am terminat cu tine.

40
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,168
Doar...

41
00:01:27,192 --> 00:01:28,480
Ce faci?

42
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,120
Ah!

43
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,314
Ce dracu...

44
00:01:33,314 --> 00:01:36,000
Ah, Timothy, îmi cer iertare.

45
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,160
Matthew.

46
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,360
Oh, Matthew.

47
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:45,760
Oh.

